WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:49.350
Someone once said:

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:53.190
There is a desert of yakisoba,

00:01:53.190 --> 00:01:57.700
baked a beautiful brown by the sun 
and covered in a sauce so tempting...

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.670
The Yakisahara!

00:02:01.170 --> 00:02:04.770
There is a tree whose overflowing 
chocolate sap covers its fruit,

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.340
creating a sweet juicy dessert...

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:10.640
The Chocolate Frondue!

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:14.750
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:19.620
The Puffer Whale can only be 
captured once every 10 years,

00:02:19.620 --> 00:02:24.260
so the stock of businesses who employ 
famous Gourmet Hunters keeps rising,

00:02:24.260 --> 00:02:27.730
setting a new record high 
for the Gourmet Index.

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:32.060
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:38.700
Prepare It! The Poisonous Puffer Whale! 
The Heavenly King Coco Appears!

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.350
That hit the spot!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:52.450
You plan on drinking all the alcohol 
they sell on board the train?

00:02:52.450 --> 00:02:54.590
I feel so great!

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:56.320
Just thinking about how we'll get to see

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:58.720
that legendary fish, the Puffer Whale, soon!

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:02.560
You feel the same way, right?

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:04.930
Yeah, of course!

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.670
The Puffer Whale is said to have the 
unique flavor of the ocean depths,

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.700
and they only show up in the 
shallows once every 10 years.

00:03:10.700 --> 00:03:13.240
And right now is that time!

00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:15.670
As if the delicate meat of a 
blowfish, like a light snowfall,

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.810
were combined with the 
highest quality fatty tuna!

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:21.050
Plus, add in the taste of whale 
meat, and you get a supreme flavor!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:22.610
I could never get enough!

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:25.250
Although you're more interested in how

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:27.920
the Puffer Whale is prepared, right, Komatsu?

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.390
Oh, you understand?

00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:33.520
The reason I'm coming with 
you this time, Toriko-san,

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:37.300
is because I want to see the techniques 
a chef uses to prepare the Puffer Whale.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:41.670
It's so hard to remove the sac of deadly 
poison inside the Puffer Whale's body

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:44.770
that it's classed as an Ingredient 
Needing Special Preparation.

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:48.710
Yeah. There are only 10 people 
in the world who can prepare it.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:52.340
Although the one we're 
going to meet ain't a chef.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.280
Hey, you!

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:59.680
I was wonderin' where all the booze 
went, and look what we find here!

00:03:59.680 --> 00:04:01.250
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:04.860
I'm the Gourmet Hunter Zonge-sama, 
and don't you forget it!

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.020
Huh?

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:08.960
Hey-hey-hey!

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:10.530
Don't be so shocked when you see this!

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:13.160
It's Zonge-sama's Full Course of life!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.000
Oops...

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.670
The Hors D'Oeuvre is Golden Caviar!

00:04:17.670 --> 00:04:19.870
The Soup is a soup made from Snag Frog Liver!

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:22.770
Those are all ingredients I use every day...

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:23.010
The Fish is Striped Salmon 
and the Meat is Crab Pig!

00:04:23.010 --> 00:04:26.380
And the Main Dish is the 
renowned Gararagator!

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:28.980
I just captured one a little 
while ago! Surprised?

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.850
It was a small one, though, 
only 1 meter long.

00:04:30.850 --> 00:04:31.950
Hey!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:35.520
Hand over the booze or you'll 
be in a world of pain!

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:40.160
You're pretty big.

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.300
Take as much as you'd like.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:47.070
Sorry about that, Zombie-kun.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:50.270
S-Sure... I'll let you off, this time.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:52.070
My name's Zonge, though... Got it?

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:55.840
I sure told him!

00:04:54.340 --> 00:04:55.840
That was scary...

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.680
Excellent as always, Zonge-sama!

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.910
They were trying to keep me in check.

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:01.980
This train is filled with Gourmet 
Hunters aiming for the Puffer Whale.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:06.250
Might be a scramble when we get there.

00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:09.950
Everyone's started sizing each other up.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:13.120
So that guy was making the rounds, 
trying to scare off who he could.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:16.230
Then, why did you give him the booze?

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:19.330
Always be kind to fellow travelers, I say.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:21.270
And if there's a scramble,

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:24.470
there's also times people should 
help each other as well.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.640
Um...

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:30.710
Could you spare some of 
that booze for me as well?

00:05:31.210 --> 00:05:32.210
Sure.

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.880
Go right ahead.

00:05:33.880 --> 00:05:36.280
Thanks so much, mister.

00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:39.150
I owe you a debt for this.

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.620
One day, I'll...

00:05:47.560 --> 00:05:50.930
There's a person in this town 
that can prepare a Puffer Whale!

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:55.370
Although... There aren't 
any people, actually.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:57.400
It's time for the beasts 
to come out, after all.

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:02.640
A fortune-teller in this town foretells 
when the beasts come hunting.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:07.580
During those times, the citizens 
all hide in their homes.

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:08.780
Now that you mention it,

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.250
it was this town's fortune-teller

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:12.650
who foretold the appearance 
of the Puffer Whale.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:15.320
There sure is an amazing 
fortune-teller in this place...

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:31.600
Kuendon (Pterosaurian Beast) Capture Level 10

00:06:31.970 --> 00:06:35.170
Boil 'em, roast 'em, you still 
can't eat 'em... A Kuendon!

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.850
He's coming to greet us?

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.720
Watch out!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.740
Just as I foretold...

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.010
I knew I'd be having a troublesome guest.

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.380
I'm so glad you came to meet us.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.250
As expected from the "Gentleman" 
of the Four Heavenly Kings.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.150
Coco!

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:22.120
The Glutton of the Four 
Heavenly Kings, Toriko!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.120
It has been a while.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:26.490
Toriko-san, is the person we came to meet...

00:07:26.490 --> 00:07:29.590
...one of the Four Heavenly Kings, Coco?!

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:35.830
My home is just ahead.

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:39.170
But why are you, one of 
the Four Heavenly Kings,

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:42.140
here in the Gourmet Fortune, Coco-san?

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.210
Because my current occupation 
is as a fortune-teller.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:47.410
A Heavenly King doing fortunes?

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:49.380
By the way, how's Zebra?

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.150
Arrested. He's in the 
Gourmet Prison right now.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.120
So they finally arrested 
that problem child...

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:00.090
This brings back memories...

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:07.530
The four of us, so absorbed with training 
in the Garden, we almost died...

00:08:08.900 --> 00:08:10.400
That was long ago.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:20.280
A monster crow?

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:22.650
Come to pick us up, Kiss?

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:26.150
Ooh! It's an Emperor Crow, 
the big boss of the sky!

00:08:26.150 --> 00:08:27.550
I thought they'd gone extinct?

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:31.990
Emperor Crow "Kiss" (Avian 
Beast) Capture Level ?

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.460
This is my family member, Kiss.

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.430
Can you carry all three of us?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.270
I have information that two 
of the Four Heavenly Kings,

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:47.070
Toriko and Coco, have made contact.

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:48.710
The Puffer Whale?

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:50.510
How is it coming?

00:08:50.740 --> 00:08:52.040
What do you refer to?

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.980
The preparations for activation...

00:08:56.950 --> 00:09:00.690
I fully approve your decision to take 
the Rainbow Fruit as your Dessert.

00:09:00.690 --> 00:09:03.820
Well, it's simply exactly as I foretold.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:09.060
Can you please eat more delicately?

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:11.660
So, how about you?

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:14.500
Finished your Full Course Menu of Life?

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:15.270
Ah, yes...

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:16.900
On my menu...

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:21.740
From Lee Dragon Tear soup 
to Breo Swordfish steak,

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:24.140
I am gathering dishes that have 
excellent nutritional balance.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.040
G2 Phoenix (Avian Beast) Capture Level 25

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.040
Neotomato (Natural Vegetable) 
Capture Level 12

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.040
Domlom (Fruit) Capture Level 30

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.040
Breo Swordfish (Fish) Capture Level 18

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.040
Lee Dragon (Pterosaurian 
Beast) Capture Level 21

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:29.110
The ones I have yet to decide on are the 
Hors D'Oeuvre, Main Dish, and Drink.

00:09:29.110 --> 00:09:33.450
They're all priceless ingredients 
with a high capture level!

00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:36.550
You didn't come here to talk 
about that though, right?

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:40.560
You're here on a job: to 
capture the Puffer Whale.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.130
Aren't you?

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.130
Well, that'll make this go quick.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:47.730
It's a tricky job.

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:53.270
Absorb even 0.2 mg of poison from a 
Puffer Whale and your death is certain.

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:54.240
Right!

00:09:54.240 --> 00:09:58.780
If you break the poison sac and it 
spreads, no part is edible any longer.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:02.550
That's why the capture 
technique is difficult,

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:05.250
and I hear that many poisoned 
ones end up for sale...

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.850
...on the black market.

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:13.120
Well, it's just so delicious, it's 
worth eating it and risking your life!

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:14.990
Capturing it without the poison spreading,

00:10:14.990 --> 00:10:17.630
and then afterwards removing the poison sac,

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:19.300
I can only accomplish 10% of the time.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:22.030
I'll be lucky to get one out of ten.

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:24.800
Those are plenty decent odds.

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:27.610
After all, I can't prepare even one of 'em!

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:30.040
I have some other unfortunate information.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:33.340
To get to the spawning grounds 
for the Puffer Whale,

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:36.780
we'll have to pass through a 10-kilometer 
long, 800-meter deep maze,

00:10:36.780 --> 00:10:39.580
in which prowl countless beasts.

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:42.490
And the most troublesome one that lives there

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:47.290
is the beast that came from 
hell, the Devil Python!

00:10:48.190 --> 00:10:49.960
Devil Python?

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:56.130
Yes... An evil beast as strong as the 
legendary Battle Wolf of distant past,

00:10:56.130 --> 00:10:58.440
said to be the strongest of all!

00:11:00.100 --> 00:11:02.440
I know it's dangerous!

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:07.450
What's wrong? You predict that me and 
Komatsu ain't gonna live much longer?

00:11:07.880 --> 00:11:09.950
Can you see the shadow of death?

00:11:16.350 --> 00:11:19.290
How many years has it been since I've 
worked as a Gourmet Hunter, I wonder?

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:20.590
Then...

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:21.590
I'll work with you.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.760
All right! I knew I could count on you, Coco!

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:25.860
Great going, Toriko-san!

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.170
How about you offer me free 
all-you-can-eat service

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:30.030
at Hotel Gourmet for the 
rest of my life as a reward?

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:32.270
You know I can't do that!

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:34.840
Why my restaurant?

00:11:34.240 --> 00:11:35.810
Shadow of death?

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:36.070
And why for your entire life?

00:11:36.070 --> 00:11:37.180
Fine, make it 10 years.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:37.180
This is bad...

00:11:37.180 --> 00:11:40.110
Look, if I did that, I'd definitely be fired.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.010
I can see it clearly on him...

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:40.650
1 year?

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:41.910
No!

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:42.180
His life is...

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:46.320
Anyway, I just can't wait 
for the Puffer Whales!

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:59.700
Good day! This is Tina, your 
reporter for Gourmet TV!

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:02.770
I am now at the entrance to the cave

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:05.100
which contains the Puffer 
Whale spawning grounds.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:08.740
Only 0.1% of people who enter 
escape alive, so they say.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:12.140
But Gourmet Hunters are venturing inside 
to try to capture a Puffer Whale,

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:14.410
each with a market value of 500 million!

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:16.280
According to the IGO's announcement,

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:19.120
there is a beach where 
the Puffer Whale spawns

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:22.350
far inside the cave's entrance here,

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:24.920
connected to the deep ocean.

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:28.030
It's impossible to reach the beach 
from 1000 meters underwater,

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:30.930
so the only way is to make your 
way through the maze-like cave...

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.270
Kuruppo! I'm filming here!

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:39.240
Toriko!

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.470
Toriko! I knew you would come!

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:46.210
Coco, one of the Four Heavenly Kings!

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:50.520
Toriko and Coco side by side... 
This is one super-sized scoop!

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:51.780
Will you please stop?

00:12:53.050 --> 00:12:56.950
Sorry... I don't really like being filmed.

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:02.430
Tina-san... Are you filming 
on your own again?

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:05.900
Yeah... It's a once-a-decade, 
heaping bowl of a chance!

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:08.430
But my staff is all scared and wouldn't come.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.970
It's definitely a tense situation here...

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.940
They're probably a bunch of people

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:15.270
planning on stealing the Puffer Whales 
that the Gourmet Hunters catch.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:19.040
It's even dangerous escaping 
from the cave, too...

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:21.480
I can see the shadow of death 
around almost all of them.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:25.450
I knew it, I'm scared!

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:29.950
Will something from within 
that cave take their lives?

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:33.160
Now then, shall we be off?

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:33.790
Right!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.390
The legendary fish, the Puffer Whale...

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:39.860
I want to know what the ingredient is like!

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:44.470
If I want to know, then the people 
of the world must want to know!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:49.240
I'll tell the world the delicious 
news of the Puffer Whale!

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.780
So, I'll come with you!

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:53.610
I appreciate your enthusiasm, but...

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:55.980
You want to follow us, then suit yourself.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.420
Act now and it's your lucky day.

00:13:58.420 --> 00:14:00.920
Wait until tomorrow, and luck 
will never come your way.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:04.120
Thanks to this headlamp 
that Tina let me borrow,

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:06.460
there's no need to worry about the dark.

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:09.730
It's a high-powered type that 
can be used for filming.

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.700
I'm glad I'm helping!

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:16.030
Ah yes, Komatsu-kun.... Make 
sure not to leave my side.

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:16.800
Right!

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.840
It's Snap Mushrooms!

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:20.840
Snap Mushrooms (Mushroom) 
Capture Level Under 1

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:20.940
Seriously?!

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:27.080
They're so crispy and delicious!

00:14:28.580 --> 00:14:30.210
Just awesome!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:31.350
Coco-san!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:34.190
We've got a whole bunch here!

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:36.190
I told you not to leave my side!

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:39.460
Viewers, these are Snap Mushrooms!

00:14:42.660 --> 00:14:45.430
A monster!

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:47.770
Don't call people monsters!

00:14:47.770 --> 00:14:50.700
And what are you dummies scared for?!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.300
Sorry!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:53.100
Are you people Gourmet Hunters?

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:55.710
If you've come this deep into the caves...

00:14:55.710 --> 00:14:58.110
Did you catch a Puffer Whale?!

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:01.910
I went all the way to the beach

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:04.680
and we're now returning 
from our grand adventure.

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:08.120
Really?! Hurry and show me the Puffer Whale!

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.290
This is a super-sized scoop!

00:15:14.190 --> 00:15:18.030
Z-Zonge-sama, t-they're coming!

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:18.800
Giant Millipede (Insect 
Beast) Capture Level 1

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:23.500
E-Eww! The cave creeps me out!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:26.100
Where is it? Where is the Puffer Whale?!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.140
Oh, it's Zombie-kun.

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:31.280
My name's Zonge, not Zombie!

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:33.440
They're looking lively.

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:34.850
What about Tina-san?

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:37.880
I didn't see the shadow of 
death, so she should be fine.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:42.650
It's gotten quite narrow...

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:45.120
Yeah, but this is definitely the way.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:48.190
The air is slightly salty.

00:15:48.190 --> 00:15:50.960
Your nose is as impressive as ever.

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:54.400
But Coco-san, how can you 
go forward without a light?

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:55.870
Unlike normal humans,

00:15:55.870 --> 00:16:01.240
Coco can see everything from 
infrared to weak ultraviolet light.

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:06.710
There are cells in your eye called 
visual cells, which allow you to see.

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:10.110
I have hundreds of times more visual 
cells than the average human.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:17.160
Even in this dark, I can 
see as if it were midday.

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:19.690
And that's not all.

00:16:19.690 --> 00:16:23.700
Coco's eyes can also pick up electromagnetic 
waves that humans can't see.

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:25.460
Yes... That's so.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:29.070
I tell people's fortunes by 
weighing the color and form

00:16:29.070 --> 00:16:32.370
of the electromagnetic waves 
emanating from people.

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:35.140
Then, please tell my future!

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:37.280
I'll become a top class chef, right?

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:39.580
The light is weakening even more...?

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:42.450
So, Coco-san, will I become one?

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.450
Wait, stop!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.560
Whatcha doin'?

00:16:50.560 --> 00:16:52.160
I'm sorry...

00:16:54.790 --> 00:16:58.700
I can hear something...

00:16:58.200 --> 00:17:00.200
Scorpion Roach (Insect Beast) Capture Level 7

00:17:01.430 --> 00:17:06.000
The Scorpion Roach melt their victims 
with a deadly poison, and then eat them!

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:08.410
I'll go down first.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.680
You'll go down and... what?

00:17:11.140 --> 00:17:12.610
Follow me, please.

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:27.430
Wow...

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:31.560
Looks like they can sense his poison threat.

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.400
Did I surprise you?

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:42.110
You can relax now.

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:46.080
In order to go up against 
poisonous creatures,

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:48.450
Gourmet Hunters create artificial 
antibodies in their body.

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:51.050
The antibodies are the ones 
that neutralize the poison

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.420
and make it have no effect, right?

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:56.450
I have immunity to about 70 different kinds,

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:59.290
but Coco has antibodies for almost 500.

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.530
Even among other Gourmet 
Hunters, he stands apart.

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:03.490
5-500?!

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:06.330
My body just happens to withstand poison

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.670
and create antibodies more 
than a normal person.

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:10.800
But...

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:14.540
Antibodies are made by injecting yourself

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:16.740
with small doses of poison over a time.

00:18:17.840 --> 00:18:21.780
I've had a great deal of poison 
injected into me for short periods,

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:24.820
and the poisons mixed together 
to a create new poison.

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:30.190
An extremely powerful poison that 
even makes giant beasts run away.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.590
Now, I am a poisonous man.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:37.160
A man who lives an undignified life.

00:18:38.460 --> 00:18:40.870
Now, let's go.

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:47.640
Coco-san seems sad...

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:53.010
Coco was chased by scientists trying 
to use his body to make a new serum.

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:57.080
He was treated like an 
extremely dangerous creature.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:02.320
It was probably to escape those shackles 
that he left the job of Gourmet Hunter.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:06.590
That's why he doesn't like cameras?

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:09.460
Toriko!

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:13.460
There's a large hole going straight 
down about 100 meters here!

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:18.470
Since I can see, I'll drop down first.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.540
Then, I'll go down with Coco-san!

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:22.040
It's fine, right, Coco-san?

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:23.740
But, my poison...

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:25.510
Let's go, Coco-san!

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:28.780
Komatsu-kun...

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:37.260
Ooh, fireflies!

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:38.890
There are fireflies here!

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.660
Sea Fireflies (Insect Beast) Capture Level 1

00:19:38.890 --> 00:19:40.930
Yes. Sea Fireflies.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.260
They get lost by the sea...

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:47.100
They're beautiful, Coco-san!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:52.470
He braved touching me because 
he was worried for me, I see...

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:57.610
Komatsu-kun, I want to protect 
your life all I can, however...

00:19:57.610 --> 00:19:59.580
If there are Sea Fireflies, then that means

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:02.380
we're close to reaching that beach!

00:20:07.150 --> 00:20:08.420
A Gourmet Hunter?

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.790
Something is coming.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:14.260
Toriko!

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:16.460
Yeah! Let's drop down at once!

00:20:16.460 --> 00:20:18.560
Komatsu-kun, hang on tight!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:19.460
Right!

00:20:25.700 --> 00:20:27.340
What are those?

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:28.940
It's a colony of Swallowtail Bats!

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.210
Swallowtail Bats (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 2

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:32.240
Komatsu-kun, stand back.

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:33.140
Right...

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.420
Poison Dressing!

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:53.300
After the poison subsides, 
they are all edible.

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:56.500
These guys are cowards 
and almost never attack.

00:20:56.500 --> 00:20:57.540
Why are they...?

00:20:58.170 --> 00:21:00.940
Yes. Something isn't right here.

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:04.310
Rather than coming to attack, I sense 
they are running from something.

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:05.910
Could it be...?

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:08.180
Where's Komatsu-kun?

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:09.950
Komatsu!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.150
Komatsu-kun!

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.150
Komatsu!

00:21:11.150 --> 00:21:12.350
Komatsu!

00:21:12.350 --> 00:21:13.690
Komatsu-kun!

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.360
Komatsu-kun!

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:22.560
Komatsu!

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:49.120
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:55.360
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:56.130 --> 00:22:02.600
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:07.540
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:12.680
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:16.050
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:20.520
on a journey with no end!

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:25.490
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:28.630
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:34.600
amid the waves of time.

00:22:36.670 --> 00:22:38.400
Gourmet News!

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:41.140
I'm your Gourmet host, Tina!

00:22:41.140 --> 00:22:43.640
Here are the ingredients 
Toriko captured today!

00:22:43.640 --> 00:22:45.510
Snap Mushrooms!

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:48.480
Mushrooms with crunchy, snapping 
bits that people go wild over!

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:54.520
Ooh, aah, take a look...

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:55.650
Did you say Snaps?

00:22:55.650 --> 00:22:58.390
Stop getting in my way, you!

00:22:58.390 --> 00:22:59.890
W-What the...?!

00:23:00.360 --> 00:23:02.360
I do apologize.

00:23:02.890 --> 00:23:04.230
And now, the next story...

00:23:06.770 --> 00:23:08.570
The Devil Python has appeared!

00:23:08.570 --> 00:23:10.700
It trades vicious, poisonous attacks with  Coco!

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.930
What about Toriko!? Oh, it seems he's preparing to use a new special technique!

00:23:13.930 --> 00:23:16.740
The Deadly Cave Battle! Fire, Five-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:23:16.740 --> 00:23:19.860
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
